  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The library was passed through Claude AI for a full code audit. Many latent bugs were identified and fixed and documentation updated accordingly. As a result, some changes may break backward compatibility in rare edge cases. 1. Group names must not be zero-length and can only contain characters that are valid in a file name. 2. Key names must not be zero-length and can only contain characters that are valid in a file name. 3. Group and Key values are case-insensitive",
